{
  "segments": [
    {
      "text": "Waddington-OT 使用跨时间进程采集的单细胞表达谱来推断概率分布随时间的演化。",
      "basis": "KG_GROUNDED",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 1,
          "quote": "It uses scRNA-seq data collected across a time-course to infer how these probability distributions evolve over time, by using the mathematical approach of Optimal Transport (OT)."
        }
      ],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    },
    {
      "text": "该方法旨在刻画每个细胞在基因表达空间中的可能来源与可能命运分布。",
      "basis": "KG_GROUNDED",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 2,
          "quote": "each cell has a distribution of both probable origins and probable fates"
        }
      ],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    },
    {
      "text": "你提供的采样设计是四个有序时间点，且每个时间点都有单细胞表达谱，这与该方法所需的时间进程单细胞表达快照在形式上一致。",
      "basis": "USER_PROVIDED_FACT",
      "citations": [],
      "context_fact_ids": [
        "user:expression_profiles",
        "user:sampling"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "提醒：该方法推断的是概率性时间耦合，而不是对同一批细胞进行直接物理谱系追踪；不同时间点细胞是独立采样的。",
      "basis": "CAUTION_CONTEXT",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 4,
          "quote": "because different cells are sampled independently at different time points, we lose the joint distribution of expression between pairs of time points, called temporal coupling."
        }
      ],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    },
    {
      "text": "提醒：最优传输计算隐含马尔可夫假设，即细胞命运只取决于当前位置而不取决于既往历史，这会影响对长时程推断的解释。",
      "basis": "CAUTION_CONTEXT",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 5,
          "quote": "implicitly assumes that a cell’s fate depends on its current position but not on its previous history (i.e., the stochastic process is Markov)"
        }
      ],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    }
  ],
  "clarification": null
}
